<cell id="cell-0"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type># MiniEyes v0 — Addendum Visual Model (Qwen2.5-VL-7B QLoRA)

**Operator:** Atom McCree
**Disclosure ID:** ATOM-MINIEYES-V0-2026-0624
**Hardware:** Colab Pro+ A100 40/80GB (L4 24GB fallback path included)
**Status:** **DEFERRED / OPTIONAL.** This notebook only runs if the primary visual
stack (GLM-4.6V + Playwright + Chrome DevTools + UX tools) has demonstrably
failed under real Orange5 / AECode load. The corpus-strategy.md §0 precondition
gates promotion, not this notebook's green run.

**Companion files:**
- `C:/AtomEons/Orange5/16-TRAINING/minieyes/base-selector.md` (§6 picks Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct as default)
- `C:/AtomEons/Orange5/16-TRAINING/minieyes/corpus-strategy.md` (§5 targets 5k-8k pairs; §8 promotion ceremony)

## What this notebook does end-to-end

| # | Stage | Detail |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Verify GPU + workdir | A100/L4 detection, NO-DRIVE flow (`/content/` VM disk only) |
| 2 | Install Unsloth (no torch pin) | Per `feedback_colab_torch_pins.md`, never pin torch |
| 3 | Fetch corpus from secret gist | Drive-free; SHA-256 verified; lane-stratified split |
| 4 | QLoRA fine-tune Qwen2.5-VL-7B | r=16, alpha=32, 3 epochs, bf16, NF4 vision tower fp16 |
| 5 | Holdout eval per lane | Cockpit / Diagram / Receipt — real scoring, no vibes |
| 6 | Hard guards + zip + auto-download | Adapter size guard, lane-completeness guard, `files.download()` |

## Honest guards (Mom's Law)

- Hard adapter-size guard (`< 20 MB → RuntimeError`). Silent training failure cannot ship.
- Hard lane-completeness guard: holdout must contain >= 1 pair per lane or eval fails closed.
- HRE-style refusal pattern check on PII / face / secret probes — fake-green response triggers RuntimeError.
- Zip refuses to package if any required artifact is missing.
- `files.download()` at the end — no Drive write, no silent persistence.
- Every claim in the eval JSON has a measured number, not an inferred one.

## What this notebook is NOT

- Not a promotion. Promotion requires the full ceremony in corpus-strategy.md §8.
- Not a license to skip the real corpus pipeline (`01_ingest.py` -> `06_ledger.py`).
  The gist this notebook pulls is a **placeholder seed** until that pipeline runs.
- Not a substitute for the operator's manual curator pass on every pair.

## Operator's 4 steps

1. **Runtime -> Change runtime type -> A100 GPU** (L4 24GB will downgrade to 2B base automatically)
2. **Set the secret gist URL + expected SHA-256** in the Step 3 cell (placeholders flagged)
3. **Runtime -> Run all** (click "Run anyway" on trust dialog)
4. Walk away ~1.5h (A100) or ~3h (L4). Adapter + eval results auto-download as `minieyes-v0.zip`.</cell id="cell-0">
